OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies 'machete' possession
OL,4,Aafter armed police response involving
OL,5,Agunshot-hit car
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has denied possessing an
OL,8,Foffensive weapon, which was allegedly a
OL,9,Fmachete, after armed police responded
OL,10,Fto a "critical incident" involving a
OL,11,Fcar being hit by gunshots.
OL,13,FSouth Wales Police (SWP) said a vehicle
OL,14,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,15,Ffirearms discharge" on Clase Road,
OL,16,FMorriston, Swansea at 16:14 GMT on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
