OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies 'machete' possession
OL,4,Aafter armed police response involving
OL,5,Agunshot-hit car
OL,6,
OL,7,FAppearing at Swansea Magistrates' Court
OL,8,Fon Monday, Thomas Patrick Gilheaney,
OL,9,F29, of Pant-y-Blawd caravan site in
OL,10,FLlansamlet, Swansea, also denied
OL,11,Faffray.
OL,13,FA 41-year-old man and 16-year-old boy,
OL,14,Fboth from Llansamlet, who were both
OL,15,Farrested in connection with the
OL,16,Fincident, have been released on bail.
